  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0:\n- Added multi-targeting support for .NET 8, .NET 9, and .NET 10\n- Added IAsyncDisposable support for 'await using' syntax (.NET 8+)\n- Added IsLocked() method for diagnostics\n- Added GetActiveKeys() method for monitoring\n- Added constructor overload with concurrencyLevel and initialCapacity parameters\n- Added DI extension method for concurrency settings\n- Improved robustness with ObjectDisposedException handling\n- Performance improvements with readonly struct fields",
